h and main, the same discriminating control and the same row count PR #144 used. Main's own agency gate PASSES with those 17 deltas inside tolerance, which is why Verify (pinned Node) is green at that ref; this file records main's current values only because refreshing the provenance hash requires re-running the sweep at all. Every moved row is well inside its tolerance -- the largest is referenceGrimoires@uniform-random-legal at -1.44 SE against k = 3. Seventeen tolerances moved with their values, so the power table in balance/README.md moved with them and is updated in the same commit; gate-power.test.ts is what caught that, correctly.",
